; refusal-pattern-budget: one pattern fanned out 8000 times. The dry-run uses
; the same 1 MiB scratch the frame path uses, so acceptance here implies the
; score can play its inspected cycle. Exhausting the budget is a diagnostic
; with a span, not an allocation failure.
(transport :bpm 120 :meter [4 4])

(track :target radius :pattern (fast 8000 (pure 1)))
